{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-160755-r4516883","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Carrot Cake I","sourcePageId":160755,"sourceRevision":"4516883","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-20T19:26:44Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Carrot%20Cake%20I&oldid=4516883","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:13.004Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cake","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using cream cheese","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using powdered sugar","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"bdf9788621fc99644259a4f90770fac4b5f47cfd874e3fbad49affcfcdac10c6","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cake recipes\n| Image = [[File:0112 Karottenkuchen, ciasto marchwiowe.JPG|300px]]\n}}__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]] | [[Cookbook:Cake|Cake]]\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Frosting ===\n*100 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Powdered Sugar|icing sugar]]\n*50 g [[Cookbook:Cream Cheese|cream cheese]] or creamy [[Cookbook:Cottage Cheese|cottage cheese]]\n*25 g [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]] or [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n*2.5 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla essence]]\n\n=== Cake ===\n*225 g [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n*225 g grated [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrot]]\n*150 g [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]] or [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n*250 g [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n*1.5 teaspoons [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n*[[Cookbook:Raisin|Raisins]] (optional)\n*[[Cookbook:Nuts and Seeds|Nuts]] (optional)\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n=== Frosting ===\n# Mix all ingredients together.\n\n=== Cake ===\n# Melt the butter and sugar together, then mix in the dry ingredients.\n# [[Cookbook:Beating|Beat]] the egg and add it to the batter. \n# Stir in raisins and nuts until everything is well combined.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 180°C (355°F) for about 50 minutes in a greased [[Cookbook:Cake Pan|tin]] with [[Cookbook:Parchment Paper|greaseproof paper]] on the bottom.\n# When cake has cooled, top with cream cheese frosting.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"rec